  pocketRead: Routine nearby pockets usually pay out Copper Ore.
  nodeRead: Heavier node clusters here usually lead to Copper Ore.
  safePocketRead: Short relief spaces often still give Cobalt Alloy, so retreat is
    not empty.
  routeRead: Route anchors hint this biome's material line before the player fully
    commits.
  rareRead: The expensive late pull of this family usually resolves into Copper Wire.
